<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .table-container { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  .table-container td { padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc; text-align: left; }
  .signature-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 40px; }
  .signature-table td { padding: 10px; border: none; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px;">LAWRENCE UNIVERSITY</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">Financial Aid Office</p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">{{ employer.address_line_1 }}</p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">{{ employer.city_state_zip }}</p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">PHONE: {{ employer.phone }} | FAX: {{ employer.fax }}</p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">financial.aid@{{ employer.domain }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">2022-2023 CHILD SUPPORT VERIFICATION FORM</h1>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 14px;">
    <div>
      Student Name: <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      Lawrence ID or D.O.B: <span data-field="id_dob">{{ id_dob }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Read the instructions on this form carefully. Failure to complete this form may delay the processing of your financial aid.</p>
    <p>Did you (parent or stepparent reported on the 2022-2023 FAFSA) receive child support in 2020?</p>
    <p>Please include payments received during 2020 because of divorce, separation, or legal requirement. Check the appropriate box below (YES or NO) and complete the corresponding section.</p>
    <p>
      <input type="checkbox" id="no_support" name="no_support">
      <label for="no_support">NO, I did not receive child support in 2020.</label>
    </p>
    <p>
      <input type="checkbox" id="yes_support" name="yes_support">
      <label for="yes_support">YES, I received child support in 2020.</label>
    </p>
    <p>Please complete the section below to verify the amount of child support that was received in 2020.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <table class="table-container">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 50%;">PERSON FOR WHOM SUPPORT WAS RECEIVED</th>
          <th style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">AMOUNT RECEIVED IN 2020</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for item in line_items %}
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
          <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ item.amount }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 20px;">
      TOTAL RECEIVED IN 2020: $ <span data-field="total_received">{{ total_received }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2 style="text-align: center;">CERTIFICATION AND SIGNATURE</h2>
    <p>By signing this form, we certify that all information on this application is complete and correct. Parent handwritten signature is required.</p>
    <p>Please reach out to our office if you are not able to provide a handwritten signature. We will provide details on an alternative way to sign this form.</p>
  </div>

  <table class="signature-table">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">PARENT SIGNATURE</td>
      <td style="width: 33%; text-align: center;">DATE</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;"></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 12px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      Secure Upload: <span data-field="upload_link">{{ upload_link }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">
      Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px; text-align: right;">
        Financial Aid Office<br>
        Lawrence University<br>
        {{ employer.address_line_1 }}<br>
        {{ employer.city_state_zip }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>